    "detailed_description": "&quot;This third-person action and horror game follows Jessie Frost as she seeks revenge for her father's death. Six years ago, the lunatics from Martha Asylum took over, killing the owner and most of the staff. Now, the once-busy hospital is abandoned and shunned by society. Recently released from prison, Jessie, the director's daughter, is ready to take her revenge by killing all those responsible.&quot;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGameplay features<br />\r\nThis game is a third-person action genre that mainly contains elements such as shooting and melee combat.<br />\r\n- Realistic style rendering<br />\r\n- Beautiful &quot;heroine&quot;<br />\r\n-The game offers a diverse arsenal of weapons, each delivering a refreshing and impactful blow, making every strike uniquely satisfying<br />\r\n-Dark and realistic atmosphere",
